This tool uses the Model Context Protocol (MCP), developed by Anthropic.

This distribution is part of the Valravn intelligence mesh maintained at
https://github.com/PrinceOfPwn/Munin (subtree: valravn/). It is the
active-testing surface of the mesh; passive reconnaissance (CTI gateway,
AS lookups, Wayback, dark-web indexing) lives at munin/valravn/ in the
same repository. Both surfaces share the .valravn-intel/<domain>/ target
intel store, scope policy and audit log.

